<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 12/13.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 12/13.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Tuesday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for August 12/13. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	   August 12/13   August 11/12</p>
<p>    CZK     0.43584	  0.43509</p>
<p>    DKK     2.10049	  2.10008</p>
<p>    FIM     2.67687	  2.67589</p>
<p>    GBP    23.51058	 23.58668</p>
<p>    HUF     0.07478	  0.07478</p>
<p>    LTL     3.71604	  3.71164</p>
<p>    LVL    25.3751	  25.32776</p>
<p>    RUR     0.00256	  0.00356</p>
<p>    SEK     1.85935	  1.86328</p>
<p>    UAH     8.01769	  8.00647</p>
<p>    USD    14.866	   14.8484</p>
<p>    XEU    15.74161	 15.73188</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
